{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|Bedouin}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fro|beduin}} (compare {{cog|fr|bédouin}}), from {{m|ar||بَدَوِين}}, colloquial plural of {{m|ar|بَدَوِيّ}}, from {{m|ar|بَدْو||desert, camp}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈbɛd.wɪn/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[desert]]-[[dwell]]er, especially a member of a [[nomad]]ic Arab desert tribe.

